si(s,x)+\\frac{g(s)^2}{2}\\Delta_x\\psi(s,x)\\right)\\nu_s(dx)\\,ds.$$\n\nThen $(\\mu_t)_{0\\le t\\le T}$, where $\\mu_t(dx)=p_t(x)\\,dx$ for $t>0$ and $\\mu_0=\\mu$, is the unique narrowly continuous weak forward solution with initial law $\\mu$. No density for $\\mu$ at $t=0$ is asserted.",
